  "description": "Romantic Couple Dancing Embroidery Design – Machine Embroidery File\nCapture the romance of a lifelong commitment with this exquisite Wedding First Dance embroidery design. Rendered in a sophisticated, minimalist line art style, this motif features a bride and groom in a graceful embrace mid-dance. The flowing lines of the gown and the structured silhouette of the tuxedo create a beautiful sense of movement and “happily ever after.”\nThis elegant sketch-style design is a “first-class” choice for wedding and anniversary projects. It is perfect for personalizing bridal shower gifts, decorating ring bearer pillows, or creating custom handkerchiefs for the mother of the bride. Because of its clean, single-color linework, it stitches out quickly and beautifully on everything from delicate silk to sturdy linen, making it a “must-have” for any bridal embroidery collection.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Romantic Couple Dancing Embroidery Design – Machine Embroidery File</p>\n<p>Capture the romance of a lifelong commitment with this exquisite Wedding First Dance embroidery design. Rendered in a sophisticated, minimalist line art style, this motif features a bride and groom in a graceful embrace mid-dance. The flowing lines of the gown and the structured silhouette of the tuxedo create a beautiful sense of movement and “happily ever after.”</p>\n<p>This elegant sketch-style design is a “first-class” choice for wedding and anniversary projects. It is perfect for personalizing bridal shower gifts, decorating ring bearer pillows, or creating custom handkerchiefs for the mother of the bride. Because of its clean, single-color linework, it stitches out quickly and beautifully on everything from delicate silk to sturdy linen, making it a “must-have” for any bridal embroidery collection.</p>",
